{"d":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><strong>Mietu galu apstrādes varianti:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><strong>PC&nbsp;</strong>- viens gals asināts, otrs fāzēts</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><strong>CC&nbsp;</strong>- abi gali fāzēti</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><strong>BB&nbsp;</strong>- abi gali taisni garināti</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Arial;\">PB&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Arial;\">- viens gals fāzēts, otrs taisni garināts</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><strong><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/varti_zogi/Stabi/gali.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"100\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" /></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 11px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); color: rgb(0, 128, 128);\">Mieti atbilst PVN likuma Reversā norēķina kritērijiem</strong><strong style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 11px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); color: rgb(0, 128, 128);\">&nbsp;- u<span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">zņēmumiem</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(59, 59, 59); font-family: Arial;\">&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">PVN maksātājiem, rēķinā par pirkumu ar pārskaitījumu, cenas&nbsp; tiek norādītas ar PVN 0% !</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 11px; text-align: center; color: rgb(153, 51, 0);\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\"><strong>Mietiņu pārdo&scaron;anas standarta vienība ir paka.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-align: center;\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 102, 0); font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;\">Mietu cenas tiek precizētas pēc pieprasījuma!</b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; margin-left: 0px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \" class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p><br><br>"}